  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Noor Saudi volunteer project to combat blindness</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="3">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">4,000 cases were examined, 400 cataract surgeries were performed, 1,000 glasses, medicines and eye drops were distributed.</narrative>
  </description>
  <description type="2">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Performing specialized surgeries. Provide patients&apos; needs of medicines, glasses and lenses as needed. Eliminate the suffering of many blind people. Health education for everyone receiving treatment for prevention. Subsidy of the Ministry of Health in the beneficiary country that suffers from a shortage of ophthalmologists.</narrative>
  </description>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Providing medical services in the field of combating blindness and the diseases that cause it to beneficiaries with limited incomes who cannot cover the costs of their treatment.</narrative>
  </description>
